To those of you who are with me, at the forefront of modern 1985
technology...

OS/2 1.3 is the solution!  ;)  I was having trouble running Nethack,
because the MSDOS binaries that are distributed require a 386 for
protected mode, however, the OS/2 binaries run just fine.

So go out, get OS/2 1.3, and you're set.  I believe IBM still sells it.
I picked mine up from a guy from $15 -- so it doesn't really cost if you
buy it used from a person who upgraded.

Anyway, this advice is just being passed on from one nethacker to
another.

